g a non-zero solution of $(A-1I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{3}=9,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-9I & =[\\begin{aligned}-8 & -2 & -2 \\\\ 5 & -5 & -5 \\\\ -5 & -5 & -5\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-9I)x=0$ gives us the eigenvector ${v}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$\n\n**Step 3.** We construct the diagonal matrix $D$ and the invertible matrix $P$ in the usual way, and this gives us the following:\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 9\\end{aligned}],\\,P=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139535919 true] [17592186374361 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374362 13194139535919 true] [17592186374361 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374363 13194139535919 true] [17592186374361 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374364 13194139535919 true] [17592186374361 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374365 13194139535919 true] [17592186374361 1000 #edb/ref 17592186374366 13194139535919 true] [17592186374361 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535919 true] [17592186374361 1041 "selection" 13194139535919 true] [17592186374361 1104 #edb/ref 17592186374365 13194139535919 true] [17592186374361 1110 #uuid "801d26a3-e76c-52aa-8ddc-d4204dcee7ae" 13194139535919 true] [17592186374362 1034 "$D=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -9\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$P=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139535919 true] [17592186374362 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535919 true] [17592186374362 1111 #uuid "07ac79b2-1252-5ab1-bbd6-e9eee2962c81" 13194139535919 true] [17592186374363 1034 "$D=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -9\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$P=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -5 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 5 & 1\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139535919 true] [17592186374363 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535919 true] [17592186374363 1111 #uuid 